# Desolace (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Desolace: the Ghost Walker centaur lines and
# clan befriendings, the Maurin/Takata chain, the Corrupter chain, the
# Shadowprey coast business, the Gelkis clan finale and the Shen'dralas
# pre (band 31-45; the L60 Economic Warfare rides as the optional clan
# capstone). Every accept is on key 1443; the Orgrimmar, Stranglethorn,
# Riverglades and Maraudon legs ride honest expedition steps below. See
# docs/desolace-horde-census.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/desolace-horde
title Desolace (Horde)
levels 31-45
zone Desolace
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Ghost Walker, the Kolkar pre

  when onquest 1362
  goto 56.19,59.57
  turnin 1362 -- The Kolkar of Desolace - Regthar's word to Felgur Twocuts
  accept 1365 -- Khan Dez'hepah - Felgur Twocuts; Dez'hepah's head, east
  note Holders of 1362 turn in here first, then take 1365 on the same terms as the muster below.

step Ghost Walker, mustering

  note Ghost Walker is the Horde hub: Felgur Twocuts (56.19, 59.57) and Gurda Wildmane (56.29, 59.68) hold the rise. Take the hub's asks here; the clans fill them.
  goto 56.19,59.57
  accept 1365 -- Khan Dez'hepah - Felgur Twocuts; Dez'hepah's head, east
  note 1365 needs 1362 (The Kolkar of Desolace, Barrens accept, unrouted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; holders use the mini above.
  accept 1366 -- Centaur Bounty - Felgur Twocuts; fifteen Centaur Ears
  note 1366 needs 1365's turn-in first (game-gated) - take it here; its ears credit from here on.
  accept 1367 -- Magram Alliance - Gurda Wildmane; befriend the Magram, Warug takes the word east
  note 1367's follow-up 1369 rides the main guide - take it there after Warug's word.
  accept 1368 -- Gelkis Alliance - Gurda Wildmane; befriend the Gelkis, Uthek takes the word west
  note 1368's follow-up 1370 rides the main guide - take it there after Uthek's word.
  accept 93225 -- Carved Centaur Totems - Gurda Wildmane; five totems off the zone's centaurs
  note 93225's totems fill on the eastern trip below - 94873 opens on the return.

step East - the Kolkar camp

  complete 1365 @73.4,43 era -- Khan Dez'hepah's head for Felgur Twocuts, east
  note Dez'hepah works seven points around (73-74, 41-48) - take the head.
  collect 6067 x15 @68.55,52.17 era -- fifteen Centaur Ears off the Kolkar for Felgur Twocuts, east
  note The Kolkar camp the east around (67-70, 41-52) - farm ears across this trip and the Gelkis loop below; Magram, Gelkis and Maraudine centaurs drop them too.
  collect 254432 x5 @68.55,52.17 era -- five Carved Centaur Totems off the Kolkar for Gurda Wildmane, east
  note The totems drop off the zone's centaurs with no rates in the data - work the camp for all five.
  goto 74.97,68.16
  turnin 1367 -- Magram Alliance - the Magram word to Warug
  note 1369 (Broken Tears, shared) opens at Warug now - it rides the main guide, not this tracker's list.

step Ghost Walker, first return

  goto 56.19,59.57
  turnin 1365 -- Khan Dez'hepah - the head to Felgur Twocuts
  note 1366's ears fill with the camp work above and the Gelkis loop below; hand them in on the second return.
  goto 56.29,59.68
  turnin 93225 -- Carved Centaur Totems - the totems to Gurda Wildmane
  accept 94873 -- Buying Friendship: Gelkis - Gurda Wildmane; the Totem Tote goes to Molkar, west
  note 94873 waited on 93225's turn-in - Molkar waits in the west below. Its Magram twin 94872 is set aside (its next needs an Alliance-only pre) - see the census.
  goto 55.41,55.81
  accept 5386 -- Catch of the Day - Nataka Longhorn; two Bloodbelly Fish, Jinar grants them west
  note 5386's fish come from Jinar'Zillen in the west below - turn them in back here on the return.

step West - Gelkis Village

  goto 36.22,79.25
  turnin 1368 -- Gelkis Alliance - the Gelkis word to Uthek the Wise
  note 1370 (Stealing Supplies, shared) opens at Uthek now - it rides the main guide, not this tracker's list.
  accept 93045 -- Test Your Theory - Uthek the Wise; Nerlokh waits in Maraudon, late
  note 93045 needs 93044 (shared, main-contracted) done first - take it here if that leg sent you in. Its turn-in is a Maraudon expedition, late, and homes the Shen'dralas chain's pre.
  goto 35.68,92.23
  turnin 94873 -- Buying Friendship: Gelkis - the Totem Tote to Molkar
  accept 92812 -- Economic Warfare - Molkar; a Carved Centaur Totem, west
  note 92812 waited on 94873's turn-in and closes the clan line - its totem fills on the Gelkis families here. It rides optional as the L60 custom capstone.
  collect 254432 @35.68,92.23 era -- a Carved Centaur Totem off the Gelkis families for Molkar, west
  turnin 92812 -- Economic Warfare - the totem to Molkar
  note 92812's totem names no count in the data - work the families until it credits.
  collect 6067 @35.68,92.23 era -- more Centaur Ears off the Gelkis families for Felgur Twocuts, west
  note Finish the fifteen here if the Kolkar camp left any short - 1366 turns in on the second return.

step Ghost Walker, second return

  goto 56.19,59.57
  turnin 1366 -- Centaur Bounty - the ears to Felgur Twocuts
  note The ears ride the Kolkar camp plus the Gelkis loop - the Vale's east is done.

step Shadowprey Village, mustering

  note Shadowprey Village is the west hub: Taiga Wisemane (25.82, 68.21), Roon Wildmane (25.05, 72.27), Mai'Lahii (22.64, 71.97), Drulzegar Skraghook (23.32, 72.87) and Aka'rai (25.32, 67.05) hold the coast. Take the hub's asks here; the coast fills them.
  goto 25.82,68.21
  accept 5381 -- Hand of Iruxos - Taiga Wisemane; the Demon Box off the Demon Spirit, north
  note 5381's box fills on the northern trip below - hand it in on the return.
  accept 5763 -- Hunting in Stranglethorn - Roon Wildmane; Roon's Kodo Horn goes to Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, late
  note 5763's turn-in is a Stranglethorn expedition - the leg below carries it.
  accept 6142 -- Clam Bait - Mai'Lahii; ten Soft-shelled Clam Meat, south
  note 6142's meat fills on the coast trip below - hand it in on the return.
  accept 6143 -- Other Fish to Fry - Drulzegar Skraghook; Myrmidons, Naga and Sorceresses, south
  note 6143's naga fill on the coast trip below - hand them in on the return.
  accept 97265 -- Hate the Hatefury - Aka'rai; Hatefury satyrs at Sargeron, north-east
  note 97265's satyrs have no counts in the data - work the Sargeron camp on the north-east trip below.
  goto 23.43,72.6
  accept 94895 -- Lost Shipping Crate - the Lost Shipping Crate; Friz takes it in Riverglades, late
  note 94895's turn-in is a Riverglades expedition - the leg below carries it. Its crate twins are unroutable or out-of-zone - see the census.

step Nijel's Point, the Orgrimmar pre

  when onquest 1432
  goto 52.57,54.39
  turnin 1432 -- Alliance Relations - Keldran's word to Takata Steelblade
  accept 1433 -- Alliance Relations - Takata Steelblade; Maurin takes the word
  note Holders of 1432 turn in here first, then take the chain on the same terms as the muster below.

step Nijel's Point, mustering

  note Nijel's Point is the north hub: Takata Steelblade (52.57, 54.39) and Maurin Bonesplitter (52.25, 53.44) hold the rise with the Burning Blade cult below. Take the hub's asks here.
  goto 52.57,54.39
  accept 1433 -- Alliance Relations - Takata Steelblade; Maurin takes the word
  note 1433 needs 1432 (Alliance Relations, Orgrimmar accept, unrouted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in.
  turnin 1433 -- Alliance Relations - Takata's word to Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1434 -- Befouled by Satyr - Takata Steelblade; four satyr kinds at Sargeron, north-east
  note 1434 needs 1432 done too - its satyrs fill on the Sargeron trip below; hand them in on the return.
  goto 52.25,53.44
  accept 1435 -- The Burning of Spirits - Maurin Bonesplitter; fifteen Infused Burning Gems off the Burning Blade, north
  note 1435 waited on 1433's turn-in - its gems fill on the northern trip below; 1436 opens on the return.

step North-center - the Burning Blade

  collect 6435 x15 @52.08,28.86 era -- fifteen Infused Burning Gems off the Burning Blade for Maurin Bonesplitter, north-center
  note The cult works around (52-57, 21-33) - farm gems across the camp; the Flayed Demon Skins (1480) fill on the same kills.
  collect 20310 @52.08,28.86 era -- a Flayed Demon Skin off the Burning Blade for Maurin Bonesplitter, north-center
  collect 6766 @52.08,28.86 era -- a Flayed Demon Skin (old) off the Burning Blade for Maurin Bonesplitter, north-center
  note Either skin starts 1480 - one pickup is enough; the Augur (5%/2%), Reaver, Adept, Felsworn, Shadowmage and Seer all carry them in-zone.
  collect 13542 @55,26.6 era -- the Demon Box off the Demon Spirit for Taiga Wisemane, north
  note The Demon Spirit holds the single point - 5581 opens back at Taiga.

step Nijel's Point, first return

  goto 52.25,53.44
  accept 1480 -- The Corrupter - Maurin Bonesplitter; the Flayed Demon Skin starts it
  note 1480 waited on the skin pickup above - take it here with the skin in bags.
  turnin 1480 -- The Corrupter - the skin to Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1481 -- The Corrupter - Maurin Bonesplitter; a Shadowstalker Scalp, Sargeron
  note 1481 waited on 1480's turn-in - its scalp fills on the Sargeron trip below.
  turnin 1435 -- The Burning of Spirits - the gems to Maurin Bonesplitter

step North-east - Sargeron, first trip

  complete 1434 @73.53,9.04 era -- seven Hatefury Rogues for Takata Steelblade, at Sargeron
  complete 1434 @73.66,10.25 era -- seven Hatefury Felsworn for Takata Steelblade, at Sargeron
  complete 1434 @72.53,21.56 era -- seven Hatefury Betrayers for Takata Steelblade, at Sargeron
  complete 1434 @72.57,15.73 era -- seven Hatefury Hellcallers for Takata Steelblade, at Sargeron
  note The Hatefury work Sargeron around (70-80, 9-28) - the 1442 Stonetalon points are noted, not used. 1481's scalp fills on the same sweep.
  collect 6441 @75.65,26.62 era -- a Shadowstalker Scalp off the Shadowstalker for Maurin Bonesplitter, at Sargeron
  note The scalp drops at 33% off the Shadowstalker - 1482 opens on the return.

step Takata Steelblade, the Sargeron word

  goto 52.57,54.39
  turnin 1434 -- Befouled by Satyr - the satyrs to Takata Steelblade
  goto 52.25,53.44
  turnin 1481 -- The Corrupter - the scalp to Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1482 -- The Corrupter - Maurin Bonesplitter; an Oracle Crystal, south-west coast
  note 1482 waited on 1481's turn-in - its crystal fills on the coast trip below.

step South-west - the Slitherblade coast

  collect 6442 @27.69,7.92 era -- an Oracle Crystal off the Slitherblade Oracle for Maurin Bonesplitter, south-west coast
  note The Oracle holds five points around (27-33, 6-24) at a 100% crystal rate.
  collect 15924 x10 @30.5,31.87 era -- ten Soft-shelled Clam Meat off the Enraged Reef Crawlers for Mai'Lahii, south-west
  note The crawlers work the shore around (30-36, 22-35) at 100%; the Giant Softshell Clams feed the same ten.
  complete 6143 @32.74,23.92 era -- seven Slitherblade Naga for Drulzegar Skraghook, south-west
  complete 6143 @32.74,14.68 era -- seven Slitherblade Myrmidon for Drulzegar Skraghook, south-west
  complete 6143 @32.94,23.32 era -- five Slitherblade Sorceresses for Drulzegar Skraghook, south-west
  note The Slitherblade work the coast around (27-41, 5-28) - work the shore for all three kinds.
  goto 22.64,71.97
  turnin 6142 -- Clam Bait - the meat to Mai'Lahii
  goto 23.32,72.87
  turnin 6143 -- Other Fish to Fry - the naga dead to Drulzegar Skraghook

step Nijel's Point, second return

  goto 52.25,53.44
  turnin 1482 -- The Corrupter - the crystal to Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1484 -- The Corrupter - Maurin Bonesplitter; Takata takes the word
  note 1484 waited on 1482's turn-in - it carries no objectives, so hand it straight over.
  goto 52.57,54.39
  turnin 1484 -- The Corrupter - to Takata Steelblade
  accept 1488 -- The Corrupter - Takata Steelblade; Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod, Sargeron
  note 1488 waited on 1484's turn-in and closes the chain - its pair fills on the Sargeron trip below.
  goto 52.25,53.44
  accept 1436 -- Alliance Relations - Maurin Bonesplitter; Keldran waits in Orgrimmar, late
  note 1436 waited on 1434 and 1435 together - its turn-in is an Orgrimmar expedition, late.

step Shadowprey Village, the west work

  goto 25.82,68.21
  turnin 5381 -- Hand of Iruxos - the box to Taiga Wisemane
  accept 5581 -- Portals of the Legion - Taiga Wisemane; banish six Portals at Mannoroc Coven, west-center
  note 5581 waited on 5381's turn-in - its portals fill on the Mannoroc leg below.
  goto 22.45,73.12
  collect 13546 x2 @22.45,73.12 era -- two Bloodbelly Fish from Jinar'Zillen for Nataka Longhorn, west
  note Jinar'Zillen records the fish as its only dropper with no rate - read as granted in flow; if the grant does not credit in-game, have two Bloodbelly Fish (item 13546) in bags instead.

step West-center - Mannoroc Coven

  complete 5581 @49.4,76 era -- six Portals Banished off the Demon Portal Guardians for Taiga Wisemane, at Mannoroc Coven
  note The Guardians hold eight points around (49-52, 70-81) - banish all six portals.
  goto 25.82,68.21
  turnin 5581 -- Portals of the Legion - the portals banished, to Taiga Wisemane

step North-east - Sargeron, second trip

  complete 1488 @56.95,75.74 era -- Lord Azrethoc for Takata Steelblade, at Sargeron
  complete 1488 @55.91,77.76 era -- Jugkar Grim'rod for Takata Steelblade, at Sargeron
  note Azrethoc and Grim'rod hold single Sargeron points (both 1443, not the dungeon) - 1488 closes the Corrupter chain here.
  complete 97265 @71.54,17.92 era -- Hatefury Tricksters and Shadowstalkers for Aka'rai, at Sargeron
  complete 97265 @72.28,19.19 era -- Hatefury Hellcallers and Felsworn for Aka'rai, at Sargeron
  note 97265's satyrs name no counts in the data - work the camp varieties until they credit.

step The Vale, home

  goto 52.57,54.39
  turnin 1488 -- The Corrupter - the pair slain, to Takata Steelblade
  goto 25.32,67.05
  turnin 97265 -- Hate the Hatefury - the satyrs beaten, to Aka'rai
  goto 55.41,55.81
  turnin 5386 -- Catch of the Day - the fish to Nataka Longhorn
  note The Vale's in-zone work is done - the four expedition legs below close the contracts.

step Expedition - Orgrimmar, Keldran's word

  zone Orgrimmar

  turnin 1436 -- Alliance Relations - Maurin's word to Keldran @22.56,52.63 era
  note 1436 closes the Maurin chain at Keldran's side.
  zone Desolace

step Expedition - Stranglethorn, Hemet's horn

  zone Stranglethorn Vale

  turnin 5763 -- Hunting in Stranglethorn - Roon's Kodo Horn to Hemet Nesingwary @35.66,10.81 era
  note The kodo horn rides south to Hemet's camp - the Vale's errand closes there.
  zone Desolace

step Expedition - Riverglades, Friz's crate

  zone Riverglades

  turnin 94895 -- Lost Shipping Crate - the crate to Friz Frazzlespark @77.1,52.9 era
  note The crate rides east to Powderfuse Port - Friz's twins live in other zones' trackers, not this one.
  zone Desolace

step Expedition - Maraudon, Nerlokh's word

  zone Shen'dralas

  turnin 93045 -- Test Your Theory - Uthek's word to Nerlokh @20.93,22.68 era
  note Nerlokh spawns only inside Maraudon (key 2652, no open-world point) - carry the word in. The Shen'dralas chain (93058 and on, all dungeon-accept) is the future Shen'dralas (Horde) round's, homed on this pre.
  zone Desolace
